          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 28586,
      "name": "General Bjarngrim",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:28586:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:9cef9e55d2fc4ba15aae9c57",
            "source:14ffc1ec6e1805b05a91c585",
            "source:eaf422b92fd141fe9c6f8c9b",
            "source:703ef0c38f0b27827adc029f",
            "source:7a1975e89fb4f8c4adc7877f",
            "source:466a2ea3096c6e294d17cd22",
            "source:32da2bfb5c33ef3b4a7ee210",
            "source:4fc498be33b8eddcb1f8f165"
          ],
          "text": "General Bjarngrim boasts that he is the greatest of his father's sons and challenges opponents to face him. His battle cries invoke iron and steel; in defeat, he says the curse ends and declares flesh weak.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 28586
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 28587,
      "name": "Volkhan",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:28587:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:38e980cf40f27ee7c4aa2d9f",
            "source:063ea6b124db425c37668d1e",
            "source:92171a7ffbbf8bf916731903",
            "source:7f7983bd52b3922690b913c8",
            "source:7c253b5fd026e471b71357c8",
            "source:646560044e36f661ce1a23c6",
            "source:0c8e68f7bd1e010a2e4ba306",
            "source:06eee4de094eea4cc67cec64"
          ],
          "text": "Volkhan is an ironworking adversary in the Halls of Lightning, whose words cast his work as creating life from lifelessness and whose ambition reaches toward conquest by armies of iron. He mourns the destruction of his creations and threatens those responsible. King Jokkum names him as a foe opposing the people of Dun Nifflelem, but that account comes from Jokkum, not Volkhan.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 28587
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
